WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
A little idea. A whole team.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Start with your Chief of Staff.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:20.000
You set the direction.

4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Give the idea a shape.

5
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Put someone behind the vision.

6
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:43.000
A vision becomes a team.

7
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Make the next step concrete.

8
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:59.000
Every ticket has a next move.

9
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
Build. With purpose.

10
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:13.000
Another set of eyes.

11
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Prove the play.

12
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:29.000
From “what if” to “one more go.”

13
00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:36.000
What will you build?
